{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6e14b9878f011554798a823dbb63b3c77f13350030d316ba08f5c4ae54bc9bd5", "ja": "（次の撮影に使う衣装が届いたので、\n千早に試着してもらうことになった）", "zh": "（下次拍摄要穿的服装送来了，\n所以我请千早去试穿。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "f4f0d9f2cdcc025c135a7f81d57678c72e28e8478d6a392dc3811f3566eee9c5", "ja": "{$P$}。\n衣装、着てみたのですが……どうですか？", "zh": "{$P$}。\n我换好衣服了……感觉如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6d30d3e059835d2331ef828a85d239ff0df80b6dbe66c2ad64996450b60dd149", "ja": "……うん、問題なさそうだな。\n実際に着てみて、千早はどうだ？", "zh": "……嗯，看来没有问题。\n千早你实际穿上后觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "2757a44f645dbf795dca497779fd6ba87ace348628248ea13a51e593cb1f285d", "ja": "サイズは……特に問題ありません。\n体にフィットしていますし、苦しいところもないかと。", "zh": "尺寸上……是没有什么问题。\n很合身，也没有哪里让我不舒服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "73e4280093ccb7c37ba6f2b599696725dbed13ee0dc9d7415475bcf9beba1b11", "ja": "ただ、学校から劇場に来て、すぐに衣装合わせで……\n何だか不思議な感じはします。", "zh": "不过，从学校来到剧场后马上试穿服装……\n有种不可思议的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "e831e553ebf51dea94770323106bb6ece57443ccbcbad8d1c858a722d1b54ca5", "ja": "制服から制服に着替えただけですから。\nまたこれから学校に行くみたいで。", "zh": "因为只是从制服换成制服而已，\n就好像等会还要再去上学一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1006_p", "source_sha256": "82e4a9d2af34de730be7452fadee8a78bd484412d801b3acc62b94560a9d9cca", "ja": "そうだよな。……まあ千早たちにとっては、\n仕事場が学校みたいなモノだけど。", "zh": "是啊……不过对千早你们来说，\n工作场所就像是学校。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "0779d7b566fdd177b7fe214d427f3baf288b8896001dfff0f37a562bd9ead72d", "ja": "仕事場が学校……。実際、そうかもしれません。\nこの世界で学んだことの方が多いですから。", "zh": "工作场所像是学校……也许真的是这样。\n因为这个业界让我学到了更多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "2725b36046c7c97946bae95e43ed10e291c8e08a07febee7ed6c6c76940aad73", "ja": "ただ、学校での私は学ぶ以前に、人との関わりを\n避けていました。ですから……自業自得かと。", "zh": "不过，我在学校连建立人际关系都一直逃避，\n更别说是学习了。所以……这应该是自作自受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c6ba51431f928bf0548e5b31dec4bb758eff9106a07a86480b4da07279966aad", "ja": "そうか……。でも、そう思うなら、\n今からでも遅くないんじゃないか？", "zh": "这样啊……但既然你这么想，\n从现在开始也不嫌晚吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "1fd834f79579c69b405b212f06ef8a66a0baed60096f80bde126db68562df974", "ja": "そうですね……でも、いいんです。\n無理に取り戻したいとは思いません。", "zh": "你说得对……不过，不用了。\n我不会想要勉强自己去挽回人际关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1011_002chi", "source_sha256": "37c02183660f79620a9977d92c456641c8ad88568d5a48ddc611e1c0a5767bd2", "ja": "私には、もう……。ありますから。", "zh": "因为我已经拥有了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "88fd5e9817eeb4e5d6a3060b534adc2f4a9ad6c15c959f1b6ae671428ea4bdda", "ja": "……そうか。ならいいんだ。", "zh": "……是吗？那就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "349269816776209af58f9375692753310d341d3be57f29a88ee6ae5daafc60f3", "ja": "明日の撮影は午後からでしたね。\nまた学校から直行になると思います。", "zh": "明天是从下午开始拍摄吧。\n我应该还是会从学校直接过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b530cfe8246b93b19ac13562ce8672e6962052b7e6cd789b4405c7719560b7e4", "ja": "そうなるかな。\nそれじゃ明日、現地で合流しよう。", "zh": "应该会是这样。\n那明天我们在现场集合吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "0783286e678a961faddff01e2eb991d9d361fedeee1f48cfbac77ebed8ff02ac", "ja": "はい。先についたら、着替えてお待ちしています。\n私たちの教室で……。ふふっ。", "zh": "好的，我如果先到就会换好衣服等你。\n就在我们的教室里……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0103_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3fb2d685bcd895416d2794e200f3b8feb1e1345bbad36e0a0b119ba62c0d3df9", "ja": "（真新しい制服に身を包み、柔らかい微笑を浮かべて\nいる。明日は、充実した学校生活を垣間見られそうだ）", "zh": "（她身穿全新的制服，露出温柔的笑容。\n看来明天似乎能一窥她充实的校园生活。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
